    <docset:ValuationSummaryAndParameters dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 262 1014 2061 1045; 1 262 1061 2139 1092" dg:style="color: darkslategray" xml:id="valuationsummaryandparameters" dg:itemprop="describes" dg:href="#propertyname">We evaluate the Pwyll Crater residential assets at <docset:AppraisedValue dg:origin="1 958 1014 1215 1045" dg:style="font-weight: bold">490,000,000 ECU</docset:AppraisedValue>. Valuation is based on a terminal capitalization rate of <dg:TerminalCapRate xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="7.50" dg:origin="1 1964 1014 2061 1045">7.50%</dg:TerminalCapRate>, capitalizing current Net Operating Income of <docset:UnderwritingBaseValue dg:origin="1 880 1061 1042 1092" dg:style="text-transform: uppercase">32.2M ECU</docset:UnderwritingBaseValue> per quarter. Residential demand from researchers arriving from Earth is stable.</docset:ValuationSummaryAndParameters>
